{"5086200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Water & Healing", "steam_appid": 5086200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5086200/extras/7067a13f2bb5255371b3e78610868b88.avif?t=0\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water &amp; Healing</strong> is an immersive 3D art experience that brings together water, nature, art, music, and gentle interactive storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a collection of virtual environments inspired by landscapes and cultures around the world. Wander through atmospheric galleries, discover watercolor artworks, meet characters, interact with the environment, and complete gentle quests woven into each space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than focusing on competition or combat, Water &amp; Healing invites you to slow down and experience each environment at your own pace. Swim through healing waters, explore gardens and landscapes, discover hidden objects, listen to music, and experience stories centered around water, peace, connection, and renewal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The online multiplayer experience supports up to 20 players at a time across the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1:Explore immersive 3D environments inspired by different places and cultures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2:Discover watercolor artworks integrated into virtual landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3:Complete gentle quests and light puzzle-based interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4:Meet characters and uncover small stories throughout each environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5:Swim, explore, interact, and experience spaces at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6:Enjoy atmospheric music and peaceful environments</p><p class=\"b